{"id":"vod_md_3010","vodId":"3010","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"黑子的篮球第二季","name_cn":"黑子的篮球第二季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230822-1/aa9b2818cee0e4304dc6b3018405dc0b.jpg"},"summary":"帝光中学篮球队，其辉煌的历史中，同时拥有五位被说十年才出现一位天才的“奇迹世代”。即使是升上高中的现在，对他们的称赞依旧不变持续被叫着。逼近他们实力并发挥力量的正是诚凛高中的王牌，火神大我。那个天赋的才能因比赛不断增加光辉更加热情，正是诚凛的“光”，然而火神是“光”的话，“影”就是支持团队跃进不会动摇的意志。诚凛高中，黑子哲也。实现了冬季选拔赛出赛的诚凛乘着气势，击败拥有青峰的桐皇学园，和拥有紫原的阳泉。终于进行到准决赛……！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-22 08:28:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/YI6n6Am3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/m9gDD1Io/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/D095bKWK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/JDx8fP2q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/1564F8aA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/quvj8rdC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/OA8KsY55/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/S0uxZyKB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/tqlnLLjg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/ZX2gRhqv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/9LPvpsDZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/WhSUxLqJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/JdpbiNGk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/0I9S6Sbm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/XnmCGRyi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/dyD71kts/index.m3